4. ccfddl/ccf-deadlines (MIT)
   https://github.com/ccfddl/ccf-deadlines
   Pinned per import: the commit or file (with its sha256) and the as-of date
   are recorded in data/upstream/ccfddl.yml.

   Used for: editions with `data_level: upstream` under data/editions/ (dates,
   deadlines, time zones, places, links), series files with
   `data_level: upstream` under data/series/, and data/upstream/ccfddl.yml
   (ccfddl's series titles and descriptions and its CCF, CORE and THCPL
   values), all written by scripts/import-ccfddl.ts. The app shows these dates
   with the tag 未核对 (not checked against the venue) and never as verified;
   its CORE and THCPL values are shown as ccfddl's. Changes: time zones are
   converted to ours (AoE and fixed offsets kept, PT → America/Los_Angeles),
   conference dates and places are parsed from free text, seconds are dropped.

