5. Official recommendation lists (no open licence; facts only)
   data/ranks/ccf7.yml   中国计算机学会推荐国际学术会议和期刊目录（第七版）, CCF
   data/ranks/caai2024.yml 中国人工智能学会推荐国际学术会议目录（2024）, CAAI
   data/ranks/cast2025.yml 中国科协《重要学术会议目录（2025）》, CAST

   Used for: the rank labels next to venues. Each file records the list's
   name, edition, release date, official page, the sha256 of the official PDF
   it was checked against, and the issuer's disclaimer. The app shows a tier
   with the list's name, edition and link, never the list itself, and the
   PDFs are not redistributed.

